<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index drops 11.7 points to 888.8.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index drops 11.7 points to 888.8.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, dropped 11.7 points on Friday to 888.8 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices fell, with the banking index falling the most, down 39.2 points to 1,266.2.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
